S('02 / Substitution cipher',[P('Replace the fixed shift by an arbitrary permutation of the alphabet.'),P('Every occurrence of one plaintext letter still receives the same ciphertext letter.')],section='SUBSTITUTION',kind='divider',take='Historical appeal: a much larger family of secret alphabets.')
